{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "2ccc2f86-fe71-42ff-b91d-812763f5c6cf"/*LaserCamera*/,
  "Description": "Geometry-to-laser converter and a standard camera in one: like the common Camera op it renders the Scene connected to it through its own lens (camera dropdown, mouse control), while every point/line/mesh drawn inside that scene is captured and encoded into the same laser frame — dots, line segments and mesh wireframes merged, with Group/transform scopes applied.\n\nPointBuffer/LineBuffer/Mesh inputs keep working and merge into the frame; a camera op connected to Camera still drives the projection, so older patches behave unchanged.\n\nSet OutputRef to a laser output of the active output setup and its scanner camera drives the projection instead, aligning the laser frame with the venue's stage-aligned geometry.\n\nAll positions are projected into ILDA 16-bit (depth/|NDC| culling), colors from the source geometry, 16-bit.\n\nSignal chain: scene geometry -> LaserCamera (OutputRef) -> the output setup's laser output -> its bound EtherDream/PONK plug. Optimization and safety settings are managed in the Output Setup; the app bar's LASER button is the master enable.",
  "InputUis": [
    {
      "InputId": "0c48ed58-1242-4f8b-869a-7396cb055931"/*DotDwellPoints*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 300.0
      },
      "Description": "Lit repeats per dot (1..64). More repeats = brighter, more stable dots at the cost of frame budget; stays under the laser output's static-dwell limiter.",
      "Min": 1,
      "Max": 64,
      "ClampMin": true,
      "ClampMax": true
    },
    {
      "InputId": "154b095b-d6fc-4283-b2b5-86778f6e68dd"/*StartIndex*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 525.0
      },
      "Description": "First buffer element to read from the direct PointBuffer/LineBuffer inputs (Scene capture reads whole buffers). Lets you project only a slice of a larger buffer.",
      "Min": 0,
      "ClampMin": true
    },
    {
      "InputId": "1683dc5c-a279-44d5-9fe9-8ef5134067c9"/*Up*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1125.0
      },
      "Description": "Camera up vector."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "1c513c59-cc3a-4a8e-b963-d21658cc9d43"/*Position*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 975.0
      },
      "Description": "X (-left / +right), Y (-down / +up), Z (-forward / +backwards) view position of the camera. Draggable from the output window when this op is selected (unless a camera op is connected to Camera).",
      "Scale": 0.01
    },
    {
      "InputId": "3f7695e3-6fe2-4034-8337-b4a98c3a4489"/*ClipPlanes*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1425.0
      },
      "Description": "Near/far clip planes of the projection matrix."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "419decc0-d0c2-475b-b618-2db7b371f144"/*PointBuffer*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 0.0
      },
      "Description": "Direct point input (particles, DrawPoints-style clouds): every projected point becomes an isolated dot - blanked jump to it, then DotDwellPoints lit repeats. Merges with Scene capture into one frame. Positions are used as-is (model space)."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "42bcabad-7b49-48d1-95a3-9b0fc2e4eb91"/*Target*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1050.0
      },
      "Description": "Point the camera looks at. Draggable from the output window when this op is selected.",
      "Scale": 0.01
    },
    {
      "InputId": "4f1f1654-6f6b-464a-8a43-74000c19f2ef"/*CaptureMeshes*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1650.0
      },
      "Description": "Capture triangle content drawn inside Scene (mesh draws, generated template meshes like DrawTubes/DrawRibbons) as wireframes. Turn off to mute solid backdrop meshes."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "4f55d55b-b51d-4a29-8788-e1ae21a80960"/*MaxEdgeStep*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 375.0
      },
      "Description": "Mesh wireframe: distance in 16-bit laser units between lit samples along an edge. Smaller = smoother/brighter lines but more points (default 4000 ≈ safety jump limit).",
      "Min": 1.0,
      "ClampMin": true,
      "Format": "{0:0}"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "5479a43a-f274-4e5d-9be7-fe214b547616"/*LineBuffer*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 75.0
      },
      "Description": "Direct line input (DrawLines-style point buffers): consecutive points form segments; separator points (Scale.x = NaN, as written by PairPointsForLines) and zero-length joints mark breaks and are never drawn. Merges with Scene capture into one frame."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "5544ec6e-0f90-4853-9af0-69da0f213c22"/*Roll*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1275.0
      },
      "Description": "Rotates the camera right/left.",
      "Min": -90.0,
      "Max": 90.0,
      "Format": "{0:0.0}°"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "6475ca9c-6ed6-4659-87d2-a602813c823c"/*Scene*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 900.0
      },
      "Description": "Subtree to render and capture. Wire your scene here and route this op's Output into a render pass; every point/line/mesh drawn inside is merged into the laser frame, transformed by the Group/transform scopes active at draw time. Capture cost: one CPU readback per unique buffer per frame."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "73241494-c686-4013-96c0-ef40d5932f7f"/*PrintToLog*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 825.0
      },
      "Description": "Logs per-source counts (captured sources / dots / segments / wireframe edges) on every update."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "8c823c87-4d14-43e3-843d-d452e008b1ae"/*MaxCount*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 600.0
      },
      "Description": "Maximum points to read from the direct PointBuffer/LineBuffer inputs. 0 = all remaining from StartIndex.",
      "Min": 0,
      "ClampMin": true
    },
    {
      "InputId": "950943bf-935a-484e-9667-16180784adc2"/*TriggerUpdate*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 675.0
      },
      "Description": "Pulse to re-read the direct sources once on the next frame (Scene capture reconverts every frame anyway; ignored when UpdateContinuously is on). Resets to false automatically."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "9ce8f8f8-25a0-44c0-952c-d74ea4e22ce5"/*FieldOfView*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1200.0
      },
      "Description": "Field of view of the camera in degrees. Same lens for the screen render and the laser projection.",
      "Min": 0.0,
      "Max": 180.0,
      "ClampMin": true,
      "ClampMax": true,
      "Format": "{0:0.0}°"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "a0c2c2c8-f247-4b9d-8993-730d502b6aca"/*Mesh*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 150.0
      },
      "Description": "Direct mesh input (MeshBuffers): scanned as a wireframe - each unique triangle edge becomes an isolated lit run, sampled every MaxEdgeStep units. Model-space positions; transform the mesh itself before this operator."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "a46a63d2-7359-4942-a19d-f1ef15e68895"/*CaptureDots*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1500.0
      },
      "Description": "Capture point content drawn inside Scene (DrawPoints/billboards-style buffers) as dwell dots."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "d62b1d2f-8b69-4f58-a8cb-9f9eb89a831d"/*AspectRatio*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1350.0
      },
      "Description": "Aspect ratio of the projection. -1 = derive from the render resolution (recommended so the laser framing matches the screen).",
      "Format": "{0:0.00}"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "e5c90440-378b-49d3-8c5c-72dcd65a2cda"/*UpdateContinuously*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 750.0
      },
      "Description": "When on (or when Scene is connected), re-reads and reprojects every frame. When off, direct inputs update only on TriggerUpdate or when sources/settings change - cheaper for static scenes."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "e7a2c41d-9b58-4c0f-a3d6-8e41f2b7c5a9"/*OutputRef*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1725.0
      },
      "Description": "A laser output of the active output setup: its scanner camera drives the projection - a calibration solve when present, else the manual look-at edited in the Output Setup. The scan field is square, so the lens aspect is fixed at 1. Empty (default) = the Camera input or this op's own Position/Target/FieldOfView apply, exactly as before.",
      "Usage": "OutputSetupEntities"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "ed234344-726f-41de-90a1-5338f7903676"/*CaptureLines*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 1575.0
      },
      "Description": "Capture line content drawn inside Scene (DrawLines-style strips) as blank-separated segments."
    },
    {
      "InputId": "f151b1b0-b820-47f6-b2cf-be1c2b339dca"/*Camera*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 225.0
      },
      "Description": "Optional external camera override: when connected, this camera op drives the projection (and screen rendering and mouse-dragging route into it), so older patches behave unchanged. Leave unconnected to use this op's own Position/Target/FieldOfView."
    }
  ],
  "SymbolChildUis": [],
  "OutputUis": [
    {
      "OutputId": "972566b4-e695-4ac5-8a35-f364e3a00cd2"/*LaserPoints*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 300.0,
        "Y": 100.0
      }
    },
    {
      "OutputId": "96ffbcee-eb76-4a81-bf5a-b8c7f72e2666"/*PointCount*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 300.0,
        "Y": 200.0
      }
    },
    {
      "OutputId": "9a391338-75db-4b1b-9b34-2a0d91bfd774"/*SampleX*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 300.0,
        "Y": 300.0
      }
    },
    {
      "OutputId": "5d962770-7de7-4000-8a09-da028d941df1"/*SampleY*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 300.0,
        "Y": 400.0
      }
    },
    {
      "OutputId": "073058b3-38ac-4560-bfbb-a1cc42ba3f22"/*Output*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 300.0,
        "Y": 500.0
      }
    },
    {
      "OutputId": "81c5a82d-0c99-40b2-9832-262c95dedf59"/*Reference*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": 300.0,
        "Y": 600.0
      }
    }
  ]
}